KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ braced arg binds later ref param: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A braced argument's conversion to a class type skips the address-of
insertion when binding a reference constructor parameter that is not
the first parameter.  From sharing_map.h get_delta_view; blocks the
abstract_environment dog-food TU.
